    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d914">

                <pb facs="0742" n="666" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg666"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/7419</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Special Agent Silliman to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guadalajara</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-03-13T15:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 13, 1916, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s urgent February 5, 6 p.m., duly presented to Foreign Office. While
                    formal reply was not made, understood from Foreign Secretary that representation
                    would have prompt attention.</p>
                <p>Department’s March 3, 7 p.m., was transmitted on March 4 direct to General
                    Obregon at Nogales. To-day received his reply from Querétaro saying that the
                    situation at Los Mochis has been misrepresented.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Silliman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
